{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-70226","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-131885","text":"graphonomous.com — Agent Interface"}]},{"id":"blk-70227","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-131886","text":"This is the "},{"id":"spn-131887","marks":["bold"],"text":"marketing site"},{"id":"spn-131888","text":" for Graphonomous. The MCP server and agent interface live in "},{"id":"spn-131889","marks":["code"],"text":"../graphonomous/"},{"id":"spn-131890","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-70228","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-131891","text":"Read "},{"id":"spn-131892","marks":["code"],"text":"CLAUDE.md"},{"id":"spn-131893","text":" in this directory first"}]},{"id":"blk-70229","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-131894","marks":["bold"],"text":"The landing page is generated."},{"id":"spn-131895","text":" "},{"id":"spn-131896","marks":["code"],"text":"index.html"},{"id":"spn-131897","text":", "},{"id":"spn-131898","marks":["code"],"text":"memory.js"},{"id":"spn-131899","text":", "},{"id":"spn-131900","marks":["code"],"text":"contact.js"},{"id":"spn-131901","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-131902","marks":["code"],"text":"build-stamp.json"},{"id":"spn-131903","text":" at the repo root are artifacts of "},{"id":"spn-131904","marks":["code"],"text":"build-site.mjs"},{"id":"spn-131905","text":"; editing any of them directly is silently reverted by the next build — and the gate now refuses an artifact that was edited after its build, so a hand edit does not even reach the next build. Edit "},{"id":"spn-131906","marks":["code"],"text":"src/"},{"id":"spn-131907","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-131908","marks":["code"],"text":"records/"},{"id":"spn-131909","text":" instead. This directory carried \"static site with no build process\" until 2026-08-16 and it is no longer true."}]},{"id":"blk-70230","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-131910","text":"For agents looking for the product"}]},{"id":"blk-70231","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-131911","text":"Do not look for tools or specs here. Use the codebase instead:"}]},{"id":"blk-70232","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-70234","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-131912","marks":["bold"],"text":"The lane this page describes:"},{"id":"spn-131913","text":" "},{"id":"spn-131914","marks":["code"],"text":"../graphonomous/v2/"},{"id":"spn-131915","text":" — read "},{"id":"spn-131916","marks":["code"],"text":"handoff/STATUS.md"},{"id":"spn-131917","text":" first"}]}],"id":"blk-70233","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-70236","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-131918","marks":["bold"],"text":"Its spec:"},{"id":"spn-131919","text":" "},{"id":"spn-131920","marks":["code"],"text":"../graphonomous/v2/handoff/G0_G1_SPEC.md"},{"id":"spn-131921","text":"; decisions in "},{"id":"spn-131922","marks":["code"],"text":"handoff/DECISION_LOG.md"}]}],"id":"blk-70235","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-70238","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-131923","marks":["bold"],"text":"The earlier MCP memory engine"},{"id":"spn-131924","text":" (not described here): "},{"id":"spn-131925","marks":["code"],"text":"../graphonomous/"},{"id":"spn-131926","text":" root, "},{"id":"spn-131927","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/README.md"}]}],"id":"blk-70237","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-70239","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-131928","text":"Before publishing anything from here"}]},{"id":"blk-70240","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"npm run test:launch   # build + re-derive + publication gate (171 checks)\nnode prove-gate.mjs   # 59 deliberate breaks, each of which must be refused BY\n                      # THE CHECK written for it, plus 1 soundness probe the\n                      # gate must NOT object to"},{"id":"blk-70241","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-131929","text":"No claim on the landing page may be typed by hand. "},{"id":"spn-131930","marks":["code"],"text":"node measure.mjs"},{"id":"spn-131931","text":" derives every figure and table into "},{"id":"spn-131932","marks":["code"],"text":"records/witness.json"},{"id":"spn-131933","text":"; a figure that is not derived does not ship."}]},{"id":"blk-70242","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-131934","text":"Corrections come in through the form in "},{"id":"spn-131935","marks":["code"],"text":"#say"},{"id":"spn-131936","text":", which posts to the Formspree endpoint recorded in "},{"id":"spn-131937","marks":["code"],"text":"records/surface.json.contact"},{"id":"spn-131938","text":" (Travis's ruling, 2026-08-17). It is a real "},{"id":"spn-131939","marks":["code"],"text":"<form>"},{"id":"spn-131940","text":" and submits with scripting off; "},{"id":"spn-131941","marks":["code"],"text":"contact.js"},{"id":"spn-131942","text":" only upgrades it to an inline reply. There is still no "},{"id":"spn-131943","marks":["code"],"text":"mailto:"},{"id":"spn-131944","text":" anywhere and the gate refuses one."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierauutlcvhisswlvg5ihf5xga6xt7hasaznuwew6ni3advbkqjk7tda","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}